SUMMARY:Dave & Buster's (Wednesday\, Wayne)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nFor those
  who want to socialize first maybe we can play pool for the first hour or 
 so since it's easier to converse this way. But pool is $6/hr cash only so 
 you can't use your game card for this. Or just get food and drinks or both
 . Then after that we can hit the arcade games.\n\nWednesday is half price 
 for all games except VR. Everyone is responsible for all their own food/dr
 inks games. If sharing games like pool then please split the cost evenly b
 etween each participant.\n\nI’m generally thinking: 1. grab a drink/food
 /chat (maybe pool if there's enough interest) 2. try to generally stick to
 gether\, watch\, and rotate in for various games. I’m down for pool and 
 any 2 or more person arcade games like racing or shooters and maybe even p
 rize games too! Please feel free to let us know what your preferences will
  be.
