DESCRIPTION:@artsbythepeople REVISION 2026: Mondays\, August 3\,10\, 17\, 
 24\, 7-8:30PM with Michelle Ortega and Paul Rabinowitz. REVISION is a 4-se
 ssion workshop aimed at writers of all ages who are committed to the craft
  of revision and submission to literary journals. The workshop is virtual.
  To register send an email to info@artsbythepeople.org with REVISION in th
 e subject line. Please send us your 2 poems or 1 short story (1500 words o
 r less)\, by July 29th. Include your bio and tell us if you’ve attended 
 an ABP workshop or event in the past. THEME: 4-SESSION WORKSHOP HOST: ARTS
  BY THE PEOPLE FEATURES: N/A PRICE: FREE / To register send an email to in
 fo@artsbythepeople.org with REVISION in the subject line. CONTACT: @artsby
 thepeople
