DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n1) Please have your Event Pass\, Student ID\, CWID
  and have a PantrySoft Registration. 2) Please bring your own shopping ba
 g!***Visitors are allowed to come once/week***\nOur Mission:  We aim to a
 ddress food insecurity across Montclair State University. The Red Hawk Pa
 ntry is open to all students\, alumni\, staff\, and faculty at no cost. S
 tay updated by following us on Instagram: @montclair_redhawkpantry\n🌻 Su
