 screening of the 1972 film Lady Sings the Blues\, starring Diana Ross in 
 her acclaimed portrayal of Holiday's life. A discussion with Montclair 
 NAACP President Diane Tyree-Anglin will follow. Light refreshments 
 provided. Part of Adult Summer Reading 2026: Unearth a Story.
