SUMMARY:Read to a Therapy Pet
DESCRIPTION:Sign up for a time slot to read to practice reading to a 
 therapy pet! You can bring your own book from home or borrow one from the 
 library! \n\nRegistration is required. Please only register for one seat 
 per family. This program is for children ages 6 and up to help them build 
 their independent reading skills. Children must attend with an adult. 
 \n\nTherapy dogs are certified volunteers from Bright & Beautiful Therapy 
 Dogs. \n\nDue to the nature of this event\, we will be unable to 
 accommodate families if they miss their time slot.
LOCATION:West Caldwell - Community Meeting Room\, West Caldwell Public Library
