DESCRIPTION:<span>Sunday School Students should arrive to </span><b><b>th
 e lower level</b></b><b><b> at 9:55am</b></b><span><span> </span>each<spa
 n> </span></span><b><b>Sunday</b></b><span>. All students will then join t
