DESCRIPTION:<span>It has been two and a half years since our Diocesan Bish
 op visited Holy Spirit\, so on <b><span>Sunday\, September 27</span></b>\
 , <b><span>the Right Rev. Carlye J. Hughes will preach and celebrate at 
 our 10am service</span></b>\, meet with the congregation after the service
 \, and then conclude her visit with a lunch (in the lower level) with the 
 Vestry and our Thrift Shop Manager. To learn more about the Diocese\, take
  a look at </span><span><a href="https://dioceseofnewark.org/bishops-vlog
 " target="_blank"><b><span>Bishop Hughes' vlog</span></b></a></span><span>
  (video blog). </span><span>We look forward to welcoming Bishop Hughes b
 ack to our community.</span>
