SUMMARY:Sign and Sing with Miss Desiree
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun and interactive music class that uses sign 
 language! Learn basic American Sign Language (ASL) while we sing along to 
 favorite songs and nursery rhymes. Move your body and play with shaker 
 eggs. Experience the joy of bubble play while we sing! \n\nBest for 
 children ages 2 to 5\n\nRegistration required.
