SUMMARY:Creativity & Wellness
DESCRIPTION:More details soon!!!\n\n \n\nPlease note: There is a $20 fee 
 for the month. If there is any financial hardship in regard to this fee\, 
 please call Cindy Concannon\, the Center's Director\, to discuss 
 arrangements. Her number is 973-618-3668\n\nPlease pay with cash or check 
 at the Library's Circulation Desk.\n\nIn collaboration with Caldwell 
 University Community Mental Health and Wellness Services The Mary Jo Rolli 
 Codey Center\n\nMore info here.\n\nFinal Collaboration Project December 4th 
 at 10:30am\n\nParticipants come together for the final meeting to complete 
 the group project and enjoy the Art Gallery Opening Reception.\n\nInvite 
 your friends and family for light refreshments at 11am
LOCATION:West Caldwell - Community Meeting Room
