SUMMARY:Play Group
DESCRIPTION:This drop-in play group encourages socialization among children 
 up to 4 years old.\n\nThe library will provide age appropriate toys and 
 books to play with while here. Caregivers are required to stay with their 
 children while participating in the group. No registration is required. 
 Open to everyone.
LOCATION:Glen Ridge - Meeting Room\, Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
UID:LibCal-10286-15984000
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/15984000
END:VEVENT
